+     * Motion-only, pointwise and chromaticity-preserving. This is a 25% blend toward a darker
+     * quadratic midpoint curve inside 0.08..0.78; exact black/deep shadows and upper highlights
+     * remain identity. It does not alter user saturation, matrices, ACR3 or local tone ownership. */
+    static float iris26770MidtonePresentationTrim(float mappedGuide) {
